### Admin 通知（需先 @token，见 samples/_login.http）
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = <paste_access_token>

### 列表
GET {{base}}/admin/notices?page=1&page_size=20&keyword=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 详情
GET {{base}}/admin/notices/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 发布
POST {{base}}/admin/notices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "class_id": 1,
  "category": "homework",
  "title": "周末作业",
  "content": "请家长督促完成",
  "need_confirm": true
}

### 编辑
PUT {{base}}/admin/notices/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "周末作业（修订）",
  "content": "更新后的说明"
}

### 审核通过
PUT {{base}}/admin/notices/1/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "pass", "remark": "" }

### 删除
DELETE {{base}}/admin/notices/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
